## Result

The Obstacle Detection Alert System successfully detected nearby obstacles and provided visual and audible alerts through the LED and buzzer. The system performed accurately and demonstrated the practical use of ultrasonic sensing technology.

## Conclusion

The project successfully achieved its objective of detecting obstacles and providing timely alerts. It is an effective and affordable solution for safety and automation applications. Future enhancements may include the addition of LCD displays, wireless communication modules, and IoT integration.

